# oc-sim scenario v1
# The SUPERSAW applet (journal/D-037): open the app menu, move the highlight
# down five times to SUPERSAW, launch it, raise the note by an octave (A3),
# pick DETUNE and raise it by ten steps (60 %), click the right encoder to
# open its input submenu, pick CV2 (two detents), close it. CV2 adds one volt,
# 20 %: the detune played is 80 %. The snapshot shows the settings, NOTE
# taking CV1 and DETUNE CV2 (`+CV1`, `+CV2`), and the seven voices.
ticks 360
20  button up down
60  button down down
70  button up up
70  button down up
90  button down down
100 button down up
110 button down down
120 button down up
130 button down down
140 button down up
150 button down down
160 button down up
170 button down down
176 button down up
190 button left down
196 button left up
210 encoder 2 +12
220 encoder 1 +1
230 encoder 2 +10
240 button right down
246 button right up
260 encoder 2 +2
270 button right down
276 button right up
290 cv 2 1000
